  "name": "primary-power-loss",
  "lab": "Small lab",
  "title": "MLAG primary power loss",
  "action": "Resets the bridge on CHR 1 and CHR 2 over management SSH with the bridge mode of the run, picks the MLAG peer that reports mlag-state connected as primary, and after a loss-free baseline emulates its power loss. In one step it takes the container veths behind the primary's ether2 to ether5 down, sets the other peer's peer-link NIC link-down over QMP and pauses the primary's guest with QMP stop, then confirms carrier loss at every neighbour. After 20 s it powers the primary on with QMP system_reset and cont, brings the links back up, waits for the guest uptime to reset and keeps probing for 16 s plus a 3 s recovery window.",
